      "created_at": "2013-10-30T23:25:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Picked up SotM fairly recently and putting this here in case there are other interested players in the Philadelphia area.</p><p>Next open gaming event that I know of that I will probably be attending is Nov. 1 (Friday) at The Games Keep in West Chester, PA.&nbsp; They have open gaming from 5pm until closing on Friday nights.&nbsp; Other open gaming days there are usually the 2nd and 4th Saturdays of the month.&nbsp; But my attendence for these days in November is unlikely due to other commitments.</p>",
