      "created_at": "2013-10-30T23:42:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ah. Games Keep. I purchased the original printing of Sentinels there many moons ago. I live in the city so the Keep is not far. I also recommend Redcaps Corner here in the city as another great place to game.&nbsp;</p><p>If you are planning on attending, I might try and attend myself!</p>",
