      "created_at": "2013-11-02T14:33:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just a final note to this to the forums that Foote and I were able to meet up for face-to-face play out in West Chester, PA at a FLGS (The Games Keep).&nbsp; Three games played, and we had a another player join us for most of the 4-hero game, and all of the 3-hero games.&nbsp; Had other game players checking things out, and also an inquisitive 10-year-old periodically sitting and observing gameplay while asking questions about characters and game status.&nbsp; (Note: Father needs to be contacted and get his child educated in necessary background information about superheroes and some other subjects.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> )</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
